@startuml architecture_layered
' Figure 3.x (alternative): Layered view of the system. The offline pipeline fills the
' data layer once; the dashboard only reads it. There is no database server and no
' separate web API: Streamlit runs the Python code in the same process as the pages.
' House style: black and white, Times-compatible font, print resolution.
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam defaultFontName "Liberation Serif"
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam roundCorner 4
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam BackgroundColor white
left to right direction
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 70

actor "Fraud\nanalyst" as analyst

rectangle "Presentation layer\n(web browser)" as pres {
  rectangle "Streamlit pages\n1 Data and models\n2 Score a transaction\n3 Flagged transactions\n4 Model comparison\n5 Overview" as pages
}

rectangle "Application layer\n(Streamlit server, Python)" as app {
  rectangle "momosentry package\nmodel bundle (IF, LOF, thresholds)\nfeature builder\nexplainer" as pkg
}

rectangle "Data layer\n(files in artifacts/, no database)" as data {
  rectangle "metrics.json\nscored holdout, curves,\nhourly, timeline (Parquet)\nmodel_bundle.joblib" as files
}

rectangle "Offline pipeline\n(run once, before deployment)" as offline {
  rectangle "prepare_data.py\ntrain_and_evaluate.py\n(fit without labels, evaluate)" as scripts
}

analyst --> pages : uses
pages --> pkg : HTTPS\n(page request, form input)
pkg --> files : loads once\nand caches
scripts --> files : writes
@enduml
